    causes: { en: "Acne develops when hair follicles get clogged with excess sebum (skin oil) and dead skin cells. Hormonal changes (especially during puberty), bacteria called Propionibacterium acnes, certain medications, and genetics all play a role. Stress and some foods such as dairy or high-glycemic foods may make it worse in some people.", om: "Ciniinaan yeroo ujummoo rifeensaa zayitii gogaa (sebum) baay'ee fi soo'oonii nafa du'eetu guutee cuqullu ta'a. Jijjiiramni hormoonii (keessattuu yeroo dargaggummaa), baakteeriyaan Propionibacterium acnes jedhamtu, qorichootni tokko tokko fi dhaan dhalootaa gahee qabu. Dhiphinni fi nyaatni tokko tokko kan akka aannan ykn soora sukkaara'aa namoota tokko tokko keessatti isa hammeessuu danda'a." },
