    causes: { en: "It is triggered when the immune system overreacts to harmless allergens such as tree or grass pollen, dust mites, mould spores, or pet hair and dander. A family history of allergy or asthma increases the risk.", om: "Yeroo sirni ittisaa qaamaa allarjeniiwwan hin miidhan kan akka poollinii muka ykn margaa, dhiraa, sanyii ykn rifeensa fi baala bineeldaa irratti baay'ee deebii kennu uumama. Fara walii dhaloota allarjii ykn aasamaa qabaachuun rakkisaa dabala." },
    howAcquired: { en: "Allergic rhinitis is not contagious. It develops when a person with a tendency to allergies is repeatedly exposed to an allergen that their immune system reacts to.", om: "Dhukkubni funyaanii allarjii hin daddarbu. Namni allarjiidhaaf yaada (tendency) qabu yeroo allarjenii sirni ittisaa isaa irratti deebii kennu walitti irra deddeebi'ee dhufu uumama." },
    prevention: { en: "Avoiding or reducing exposure to triggers — keeping windows closed in pollen season, using dust-mite-proof bedding, washing pets regularly and avoiding smoke — reduces symptoms. Antihistamines and nasal steroid sprays are common treatments. Immunotherapy can help in severe cases.", om: "Wantoota dhukkuba kakaasan irraa fagaachuu ykn hir'isuu — yeroo sabbata poollinii foddaa cufachuu, sireewwan dhiraa ittisan fayyadamuu, bineeldota yeroo irra deddeebi'ee dhiqachuu fi aara irraa fagaachuu — mallattoowwan hir'isa. Qorichootni antihistamine fi gaabbii funyaanii steroydii qaban wal'aansa waliigalaa. Yeroo cimaa immunotherappiin gargaaruu danda'a." },
